{"seq":1,"slug":"lr-parsing","title":"LR 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/bottom-up/lr-parsing","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"lr-分析\">LR 分析</h1><p>自顶向下的解析器在每个分叉处都要赌一把：「接下来该展开哪条产生式？」赌错了要么回溯、要么干脆解析不了。LR 分析换了个完全相反的姿态——它不赌。它从输入左端一路读进来，把见到的符号堆在栈上（移进，shift），一旦栈顶恰好凑齐某条产生式的右部，就把它们归约（reduce）回左边的非终结符。因为「先看见、再归约」，它在做决策时手里的信息比自顶向下多得多，于是能处理一大批 LL 处理不了的文法。LR 的两个字母含义是：从左到右扫描（Left-to-right），构造最右推导的逆（Rightmost derivation in reverse）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LR 解析器是一台移进-归约自动机，由一个栈和一张分析表驱动。栈上交替存放状态和文法符号；分析表分两部分：ACTION 表告诉它在某状态见到某终结符时该「移进」「归约」「接受」还是「报错」，GOTO 表告诉它归约后该转到哪个状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;初始: 栈仅含状态 0&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;查 ACTION 状态 当前token&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|移进 s_n| C[&quot;把 token 和状态 n 压栈&lt;br/&gt;前进一个 token&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|归约 A 到 beta| D[&quot;弹出 beta 长度个符号&lt;br/&gt;查 GOTO 压入 A 和新状态&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|接受| E[&quot;解析成功&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|报错| F[&quot;进入错误恢复&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; B&#10;  D --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"初始: 栈仅含状态 0\"] --&gt; B{\"查 ACTION 状态 当前token\"}\n  B --&gt;|移进 s_n| C[\"把 token 和状态 n 压栈&lt;br/&gt;前进一个 token\"]\n  B --&gt;|归约 A 到 beta| D[\"弹出 beta 长度个符号&lt;br/&gt;查 GOTO 压入 A 和新状态\"]\n  B --&gt;|接受| E[\"解析成功\"]\n  B --&gt;|报错| F[\"进入错误恢复\"]\n  C --&gt; B\n  D --&gt; B</pre><p>与 <a href=\"../top-down/ll-parsing\">LL 分析</a> 对照：LL 的栈里放「还期待解析什么」（自顶向下的目标），LR 的栈里放「已经解析出了什么」（自底向上的成果）。整个主循环就是反复查表、移进或归约：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"parse():&#10;  栈 = [状态 0]&#10;  while true:&#10;    s = 栈顶状态; a = 当前 token&#10;    switch ACTION[s, a]:&#10;      移进 s&#39;:&#10;        把 a 和 s&#39; 压栈; 前进一个 token&#10;      归约 A -&gt; β:&#10;        pop 2*|β| 次; s&#39; = 栈顶状态&#10;        压入 A 和 GOTO[s&#39;, A]        // 归约后才用 GOTO 转移&#10;      接受: return 成功&#10;      报错: 进入错误恢复\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>parse():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  栈 = [状态 0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    s = 栈顶状态; a = 当前 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    switch ACTION[s, a]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      移进 s':</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        把 a 和 s' 压栈; 前进一个 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      归约 A -> β:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pop 2*|β| 次; s' = 栈顶状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        压入 A 和 GOTO[s', A]        // 归约后才用 GOTO 转移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      接受: return 成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      报错: 进入错误恢复</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这也呼应 <a href=\"../foundations/grammars-cfg\">上下文无关文法</a> 里的区分——LL 对应最左推导，LR 对应最右推导的逆过程：归约的顺序倒过来看，正好是一条最右推导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"项与-lr-0-自动机\">项与 LR(0) 自动机</h2><p>LR 怎么知道「栈顶凑齐了某条产生式」？靠「项」（item）这个核心概念。一个 LR(0) 项是一条产生式加一个点，点标记「已经看到右部的多少」。例如产生式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to XYZ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 有四个项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>Z</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Y</mi><mi>Z</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Z</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>⋅</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to \\cdot XYZ \\qquad A \\to X \\cdot YZ \\qquad A \\to XY \\cdot Z \\qquad A \\to XYZ \\cdot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>点在最右（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>⋅</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to XYZ\\cdot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span></span></span></span></span>）表示右部已完整，可以归约。把「当前可能正处于哪些项」的集合做闭包（closure）并按读入符号做转移（goto），就得到 LR(0) 自动机——它的每个状态是一组项，正是分析表里那些「状态」的来历。</p>\n<p>构造分析表时，移进项决定 ACTION 的移进，完整项决定归约。问题在于：当一个状态里同时有「可移进」和「可归约」的项，或两个不同的归约项，就出现冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-lr-0-到-slr-再到规范-lr-1\">从 LR(0) 到 SLR 再到规范 LR(1)</h2><p>LR 不是一个算法，而是一族能力递增的算法，区别在于「用多少信息来决定何时归约」。下表是这一族的全景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>归约决策依据</th>\n<th>表大小</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LR(0)</td>\n<td>见到完整项就归约</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>最弱，几乎都冲突</td>\n<td>仅教学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLR(1)</td>\n<td>归约前查 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FOLLOW</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FOLLOW}(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FOLLOW</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>简单文法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规范 LR(1)</td>\n<td>每个项带精确前瞻集</td>\n<td>巨大</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>理论上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LALR(1)</td>\n<td>合并同心状态的前瞻</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>接近规范 LR(1)</td>\n<td>工程标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LR(0) 太天真：只要状态里有完整项就归约，不看下一个 token，所以稍复杂的文法到处是移进-归约冲突。SLR(1) 改进一点：归约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 前先看下一个 token 是否在 <a href=\"../foundations/grammars-cfg\">FOLLOW(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>)</a> 里，不在就不归约——这消解掉相当多冲突。但 FOLLOW 是「全局」的（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 在任何上下文里能跟的所有 token），有时太粗。</p>\n<p>规范 LR(1) 最精确：它给每个项额外附带一个前瞻终结符，项变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[A \\to \\alpha \\cdot \\beta, a]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，意思是「只有下一个 token 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 时才考虑这条」。前瞻是针对具体上下文算的，比 FOLLOW 细得多，因而能力最强——它恰好能识别全部确定性上下文无关语言。代价是状态数爆炸，对真实编程语言文法动辄上万状态，表大到不实用。这个「太精确所以太大」的矛盾，正是下一篇 <a href=\"lalr-generators\">LALR 与解析器生成器</a> 要解决的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lr-为何强于-ll\">LR 为何强于 LL</h2><p>LR 家族最实际的优势，是它接受的文法严格多于 LL。原因有两条，都源于「自底向上」这一根本姿态。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>LR 接受左递归，而且偏好它</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E \\to E + T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 对 <a href=\"../top-down/recursive-descent\">递归下降</a> 是灾难，但对 LR 毫无障碍——它只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 移进栈，凑齐就归约，没有任何无限递归。这意味着用 LR 工具时，你可以直接写最自然的左递归文法，不必像写 LL 那样先做 <a href=\"../foundations/grammars-cfg\">消左递归</a> 的手术。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>LR 做决策时信息更多</strong>。自顶向下在见到一条产生式的开头时就得决定用不用它；LR 则可以一直移进，等到右部完整、信息齐全时才决定归约。形象地说，LL 必须「在句子开头就猜出整句结构」，LR 可以「读完一个短语再说」。形式上，LR(1) 能识别的语言类真包含 LL(1)，凡 LL(1) 文法皆可改造成 LR(1)，反之不然。</p>\n<p>代价是 LR 几乎无法手写——分析表必须由工具从文法生成，且生成时若有冲突，错误信息往往晦涩（「状态 47 有移进-归约冲突」），调试体验远不如手写 <a href=\"../top-down/recursive-descent\">递归下降</a>。这是两大范式之间最核心的工程取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LR 分析是自底向上的移进-归约：见符号就移进压栈，栈顶凑齐产生式右部就归约，对应最右推导的逆过程。</li>\n<li>它用「带点的项」追踪「已看到右部多少」，项集的闭包与转移构成 LR(0) 自动机，即分析表的状态来源。</li>\n<li>LR 是一族算法：LR(0) 最弱，SLR(1) 用 FOLLOW 改进，规范 LR(1) 用精确前瞻最强但表爆炸，LALR(1) 是工程折中。</li>\n<li>LR 严格强于 LL：它天然接受并偏好左递归，且能等右部完整再决策，信息更多；代价是必须工具生成、冲突诊断晦涩、难以手写。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LR 分析","id":"lr-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"项与 LR(0) 自动机","id":"项与-lr-0-自动机"},{"level":2,"text":"从 LR(0) 到 SLR 再到规范 LR(1)","id":"从-lr-0-到-slr-再到规范-lr-1"},{"level":2,"text":"LR 为何强于 LL","id":"lr-为何强于-ll"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"解析器组合子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/top-down/parser-combinators"},"next":{"title":"LALR 与解析器生成器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/bottom-up/lalr-generators"}}